WEBVTT

00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:11.919
Hi there.

00:00:11.919 --> 00:00:14.559
Welcome to this video
where we are going to learn

00:00:14.559 --> 00:00:18.031
about using privacy
settings in digital environments.

00:00:18.799 --> 00:00:23.071
The goal of the video is to help you
to know what privacy settings are

00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:27.599
and how you can make mindful choices
when you use social media applications.

00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:32.159
In the video, firstly,
we will look at what social media is.

00:00:32.911 --> 00:00:37.631
Following this, we will explore
what privacy are on social media apps.

00:00:38.303 --> 00:00:41.551
Finally, we will consider
how we can make mindful choices

00:00:41.551 --> 00:00:44.543
about our privacy settings.

00:00:49.023 --> 00:00:50.335
People in today's world

00:00:50.335 --> 00:00:53.343
spend a lot of time using digital devices.

00:00:53.695 --> 00:00:56.815
Computers, smartphones, 
and tablets are examples

00:00:56.815 --> 00:01:00.735
of digital devices that make up
the digital environment around us.

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:04.063
Digital devices can help 
us through social media applications

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:07.055
to connect with family and friends.

00:01:07.455 --> 00:01:11.455
For example, we send messages
and photos using messaging apps.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:17.519
Which social media applications
do you or your family use?

00:01:21.551 --> 00:01:25.343
Privacy settings can be found on
every social media application,

00:01:25.423 --> 00:01:28.991
and are designed to give users
the ability to decide who can see

00:01:28.991 --> 00:01:32.831
their online profile, what content
people can see on their profile,

00:01:33.023 --> 00:01:35.631
and if people have the ability
to contact them.

00:01:35.631 --> 00:01:38.831
For example,
call them or send an instant message.

00:01:39.631 --> 00:01:43.343
Different social media platforms
have different privacy settings.

00:01:43.951 --> 00:01:48.623
Therefore, it is important to be mindful
when you sign up to a new application

00:01:48.671 --> 00:01:51.951
and double check that the privacy 
settings are going to enable you

00:01:51.951 --> 00:01:55.823
to have control over who is 
able to see your online content or not.

00:01:56.591 --> 00:02:00.143
Most applications allow you
to have a publicly open profile

00:02:00.223 --> 00:02:04.063
where everyone using the platform
can see your personal information.

00:02:05.679 --> 00:02:10.239
For example, a personal photo 
of you, your status, and other information

00:02:10.239 --> 00:02:13.711
about you such as age, 
gender, where you go to school.

00:02:14.479 --> 00:02:18.399
Whilst it is nice to share photos
and your status with family and friends.

00:02:18.479 --> 00:02:20.479
Consider whether you want all users

00:02:20.479 --> 00:02:23.471
of the social media platform
to see these things.

00:02:24.415 --> 00:02:27.855
Most applications track 
the internet address or position

00:02:27.855 --> 00:02:29.455
to reveal your location.

00:02:29.455 --> 00:02:32.463
Sometimes showing the exact address.

00:02:32.463 --> 00:02:36.223
Whilst it might be a good idea to share
your location with family members.

00:02:36.303 --> 00:02:40.734
It is not recommended to reveal it to
everyone using the social media platform.

00:02:41.454 --> 00:02:43.694
You might also want to consider
whether this is

00:02:43.694 --> 00:02:46.702
something you need to share with
some of your friends.

00:02:46.702 --> 00:02:47.662
For example,

00:02:47.662 --> 00:02:51.022
maybe you do not want all your friends
to see that you have an appointment

00:02:51.022 --> 00:02:51.822
with a doctor.

00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:55.838
We see that

00:02:55.838 --> 00:02:59.758
influences on social media post
to the whole world to gain followers,

00:02:59.886 --> 00:03:02.878
exchanging their personal for the money
gain.

00:03:03.374 --> 00:03:06.142
However, we should 
avoid posting everything

00:03:06.142 --> 00:03:09.886
to the whole world and carefully
consider our privacy settings

00:03:09.982 --> 00:03:12.974
when using social media applications.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.038
Here are some examples of questions

00:03:17.038 --> 00:03:20.158
you might ask yourself
when setting up a new application.

00:03:21.038 --> 00:03:24.910
Do I want my teachers at school
to see videos I post with my friends?

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:29.230
Do I want to be messaged by anybody
using the social media platform?

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:32.318
Or only people who are 
in my phone contact list?

00:03:32.558 --> 00:03:36.158
Do I want complete strangers
to see my summer holiday photos?

00:03:37.534 --> 00:03:42.526
Do I want anybody to see where 
I am located on the map any time?

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:44.238
Be mindful.

00:03:44.238 --> 00:03:47.230
Who do you want to give access
to your online content?

00:03:47.838 --> 00:03:50.798
You can think about this
and maybe discuss it with a parent

00:03:50.798 --> 00:03:54.238
before checking the privacy settings
of any applications that you have.

00:03:59.342 --> 00:04:01.000
One thing to consider is

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.262
that even if you have control
over your own privacy settings,

00:04:03.294 --> 00:04:05.934
others that you share content with

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:08.942
might not have control 
over their privacy settings.

00:04:09.022 --> 00:04:12.814
This can lead to content
about you being shared more widely via

00:04:12.814 --> 00:04:15.822
someone else's social media applications.

00:04:16.542 --> 00:04:17.470
Be mindful.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:21.102
Check your own privacy settings 
and inform others of your right to choose

00:04:21.102 --> 00:04:24.942
what content about you is shared 
via their online platforms.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.510
So in this short video,

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:33.678
we learned that we are
part of the digital environment.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.718
When we are using 
social media applications,

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:41.038
privacy settings are designed
to give users the ability to decide who

00:04:41.038 --> 00:04:45.438
can see their online profile, 
what content people can see on their profile,

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.670
and if people have the ability
to contact them or not.

00:04:49.518 --> 00:04:53.262
We can be mindful and make 
good choices about these privacy settings

00:04:53.358 --> 00:04:57.742
by asking ourselves, who do 
I want to give access to my online content?

00:04:59.614 --> 00:05:01.182
Thank you for watching.

00:05:01.182 --> 00:05:04.142
Do not forget to watch
other videos in our series.

